  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWe defined `<meta name=\"text-scale\" content=\"scale\" />` in CSS at https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-5/#text-scale-meta, but should probably mention this new string/keyword in HTML.\n\nSee [the explainer](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/blob/main/css-env-1/explainers/meta-text-scale.md) for more details",
